      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "This application under Section 483 Cr.P.C. has been filed seeking direction to the court below for early disposal of Criminal Case No. 504 of 2023 (State Vs. Vipin Pandey and Other), arising out of Case Crime No. 116 of 2022, under Sections 498A, 323, 504, 506 I.P.C. and Section 3/4 of D.P. Act,\nPolice Station - Chunar, District - Mirzapur, pending in the Court of learned Civil Judge (Junior Division) / Fast Track Court / Cruelty Against Women Court, Mirzapur.\nConsidering the fact that the case has remained pending since 2023.",
